{
  "comment": [
    "The foreground/background pairs of the theme token contract that the",
    "contrast harness measures. Every pair names the CSS custom properties",
    "it reads, so a reviewer can check the list against the token file",
    "without running anything.",
    "",
    "The category fixes the WCAG 2.2 threshold the harness applies:",
    "  body-text    4.5:1  (WCAG 1.4.3, normal-size text)",
    "  large-text   3:1    (WCAG 1.4.3, large-scale text)",
    "  ui-component 3:1    (WCAG 1.4.11, component boundaries)",
    "",
    "Every pair also states its own threshold, so the list carries the",
    "requirement in full and can be reviewed without the harness. The",
    "harness rejects a pair whose threshold disagrees with its category.",
    "",
    "A pair is checked in both themes: the light values come from the :root",
    "block and the dark values from the .dark block of the token file."
  ],
  "pairs": [
    {
      "id": "body-text-on-background",
      "category": "body-text",
      "threshold": 4.5,
      "foreground": "--color-text-body",
      "background": "--color-background",
      "surface": "Body copy on the page background"
    },
    {
      "id": "body-text-on-muted",
      "category": "body-text",
      "threshold": 4.5,
      "foreground": "--color-text-body",
      "background": "--color-muted",
      "surface": "Body copy on a muted surface (card, code block, inset panel)"
    },
    {
